span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"entry product type-product post-77774 status-publish instock product_cat-0-90-days product_cat-gastric-sleeve-vitamins product_cat-vitamins-2 product_tag-gastric-sleeve-vitamins product_tag-vitamin-kits has-post-thumbnail virtual taxable purchasable product-type-composite\">\n\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-sleeve-starter-kit/\" class=\"woocommerce-LoopProduct-link woocommerce-loop-product__link\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-woocommerce_thumbnail size-woocommerce_thumbnail\" alt=\"gastric sleeve anatomy\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-75x75.jpg.webp 75w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-180x180.jpg.webp 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1.jpg.webp 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\"><h2 class=\"woocommerce-loop-product__title\">Gastric Sleeve Starter Kit</h2>\n\t<span class=\"price\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">$</span>117.50</bdi></span></span>\n</a><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-sleeve-starter-kit/\" aria-describedby=\"woocommerce_loop_add_to_cart_link_describedby_77774\" data-quantity=\"1\" class=\"button product_type_composite add_to_cart_button\" data-product_id=\"77774\" data-product_sku=\"\" aria-label=\"Read more about “Gastric Sleeve Starter Kit”\" rel=\"nofollow\">Select options</a>\t<span id=\"woocommerce_loop_add_to_cart_link_describedby_77774\" class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"entry product type-product post-77830 status-publish last instock product_cat-0-90-days product_cat-sadi-vitamins product_cat-vitamins-2 product_tag-sadi-vitamins product_tag-sips-vitamins product_tag-vitamin-kits product_tag-vitamins-3 has-post-thumbnail virtual taxable purchasable product-type-composite\">\n\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product/sadi-starter-kit/\" class=\"woocommerce-LoopProduct-link woocommerce-loop-product__link\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-woocommerce_thumbnail size-woocommerce_thumbnail\" alt=\"SADI/SIPS Starter Kit\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1-75x75.jpg.webp 75w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1-180x180.jpg.webp 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2024/07/SADI-no-title-600x600-1.jpg.webp 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\"><h2 class=\"woocommerce-loop-product__title\">SADI/SIPS Starter Kit</h2>\n\t<span class=\"price\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><bdi><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">$</span>170.75</bdi></span></span>\n</a><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product/sadi-starter-kit/\" aria-describedby=\"woocommerce_loop_add_to_cart_link_describedby_77830\" data-quantity=\"1\" class=\"button product_type_composite add_to_cart_button\" data-product_id=\"77830\" data-product_sku=\"\" aria-label=\"Read more about “SADI/SIPS Starter Kit”\" rel=\"nofollow\">Select options</a>\t<span id=\"woocommerce_loop_add_to_cart_link_describedby_77830\" class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vitamins are not tolerated on an empty stomach. Always take your vitamins later in the day. Best time to take your multivitamin is after lunch or dinner.</span></p>\n<p>After 3 months you may begin taking capsule supplements based on your tolerance.</p>\n<p><b>B-12 must remain sublingual or injectable long-term.&nbsp; Oral tablets will not be absorbed.</b></p>\n<p><b>Vitamin Tips and Information:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><b>The form of iron that you need to take is either Ferrous Fumarate or Ferrous Gluconate. </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Ferrous Sulfate is the most commonly prescribed form of iron but it not well absorbed after your surgery.&nbsp; It is also recommended that you avoid taking iron supplements at the same time as consuming coffee, tea, or antacids.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>If you are ever required to take Vitamin D, you want to make sure it’s<b> Vitamin D3.&nbsp;</b></p>\n<p>The form of calcium you should choose is<b> calcium citrate.</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This is due to the lack of stomach acid being produced by your new pouch.&nbsp; Calcium carbonate is the most common form found, but it is not absorbed well because it does require a larger amount of stomach acid to be absorbed.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span><b>Calcium and iron need to be spaced 2 hours apart.&nbsp; They actually compete for the same absorption sites and can interfere with each other’s absorption.&nbsp;</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span><b>Products to Avoid:</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centrum</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One-A-Day</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flintstones</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Generic store brands</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">“Gummy” type vitamins&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Sleeve Vitamins</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/sleeverny/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-sleeve-600x600-1.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"gastric sleeve\" title=\"gastric-sleeve-600x600\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-sleeve-600x600-1.jpg.webp 600w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-sleeve-600x600-1-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-sleeve-600x600-1-150x150.jpg.webp