></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">SADI-S Vitamins</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/sadi-sips-vitamins-2/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"sadi-s anatomy\" title=\"SADI 600x600\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1.jpg.webp 600w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1-75x75.jpg.webp 75w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/SADI-600x600-1-180x180.jpg.webp 180w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Band Vitamins</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/bandvitamins/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"gastric band\" title=\"gastric-band-600x600\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1.jpg.webp 600w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1-75x75.jpg.webp 75w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2016/09/gastric-band-600x600-1-180x180.jpg.webp 180w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-1/5\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Optional Biotin</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/bandvitamins/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/01/BA-biotin-new-1-e1721231415701.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"bariatric advantage biotin capsules\" title=\"BA biotin new\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div></div>",
  "bodyMarkdown": "Vitamin supplements after bariatric surgery are an important post-op consideration.  It is critical that you follow our guidelines in terms of recommended vitamins as well as post-op labwork to reduce the risk of vitamin or micronutrient deficiencies!  We recommend only pharmaceutical-grade vitamins for our patients.  Check our (https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/) for all your vitamin needs!\n\n**DO NOT START ANY VITAMINS UNTIL DISCUSSING WITH OUR TEAM AT YOUR FIRST POST-OP VISIT!**\n\n**Vitamin Supplementation for Gastric Bypass, Gastric Sleeve, SIPS/SADI, and Gastric Band**\n\nVitamins & minerals start one month after surgery. The exception is sublingual vitamin B12 which starts one week after surgery.  Your dietitian will discuss with you which vitamins & minerals you will need to take.    \n\n The following are required to be taken after your surgery:\n\n-   **1 week post surgery:**\n    -   **At 1 week out you will begin taking Sublingual B-12 (1,000 mcg) daily until your 1 month visit.** \n\n-   [!(/legacy-blog/vitamins__BA-b12-black-cherry-500x500.jpg.webp.webp)\n\n    ## B12 (2)\n\n    ](https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/b-vitamins/vitamin-b12/)\n\n-   **1 month post surgery**\n    -   Begin chewable multivitamin\n    -   Iron (ferrous fumarate-18mg/d),\n    -   Vitamin D3 (15,000 IU/weekly)\n    -   Calcium Citrate (1000 mg/d, _ONLY take 500 mg at one time to increase absorption_)\n    -   Decrease sublingual B12 to 1,000 mcg/week.\n\nOur pharmaceutical-grade Ultra Solo chewable multivitamin in our vitamin kits also has all the iron and vitamin D3 you need built in!\n\n## Vitamin Starter Kits\n\n-   [!(/legacy-blog/vitamins-after-weight-loss-surgery-90-days-and-beyond__gastric-band-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp.webp)\n\n    ## Gastric Band Starter Kit\n\n    $60.00](https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-band-starter-kit/) (https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-band-starter-kit/)\n-   [!(/legacy-blog/vitamins-after-weight-loss-surgery-90-days-and-beyond__gastric-bypass-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp.webp)\n\n    ## Gastric Bypass Starter Kit\n\n    $117.50](https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-bypass-starter-kit/) (https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-bypass-starter-kit/)\n-   [!(/legacy-blog/vitamins-after-weight-loss-surgery-90-days-and-beyond__gastric-sleeve-illustration-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp.webp)\n\n    ## Gastric Sleeve Starter Kit\n\n    $117.50](https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-sleeve-starter-kit/) (https://journeylite.com/product/gastric-sleeve-starter-kit/)\n-   [!(/legacy-blog/vitamins-after-weight-loss-surgery-90-days-and-beyond__SADI-no-title-600x600-1-500x500.jpg.webp.webp)\n\n    ## SADI/SIPS Starter Kit\n\n    $170.75](https://journeylite.com/product/sadi-starter-kit/) (https://journeylite.com/product/sadi-starter-kit/)\n\nVitamins are not tolerated on an empty stomach. Always take your vitamins later in the day. Best time to take your multivitamin is after lunch or dinner.\n\nAfter 3 months you may begin taking capsule supplements based on your tolerance.\n\n**B-12 must remain sublingual or injectable long-term.  Oral tablets will not be absorbed.**\n\n**Vitamin Tips and Information:** \n\n**The form of iron that you need to take is either Ferrous Fumarate or Ferrous Gluconate.**  Ferrous Sulfate is the most commonly prescribed form of iron but it not well absorbed after your surgery.  It is also recommended that you avoid taking iron supplements at the same time as consuming coffee, tea, or antacids.   \n\nIf you are ever required to take Vitamin D, you want to make sure it’s **Vitamin D3.** \n\nThe form of calcium you should choose is **calcium citrate.** This is due to the lack of stomach acid being produced by your new pouch.  Calcium carbonate is the most common form found, but it is not absorbed well because it does require a larger amount of stomach acid to be absorbed. \n\n **Calcium and iron need to be spaced 2 hours apart.  They actually compete for the same absorption sites and can interfere with each other’s absorption.** \n\n **Products to Avoid:** \n\n-   Centrum\n-   One-A-Day\n-   Flintstones\n-   Generic store brands\n-   “Gummy” type vitamins \n\n## Sleeve Vitamins\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/sleeverny/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## Bypass Vitamins\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/sleeverny/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## SADI-S Vitamins\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/sadi-sips-vitamins-2/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## Band Vitamins\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/bandvitamins/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## Optional Biotin\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/product-category/vitamins-2/bandvitamins/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>",
